<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>At BookHive, we are committed to protecting your privacy. We collect only the information necessary to provide you with a better browsing and user experience. Any personal information you share with us, such as your name or email address, will be kept confidential and will not be sold, shared, or disclosed to third parties without your consent, unless required by law. We use secure technologies to safeguard your information and continually update our practices to ensure your data stays protected. By using our site, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.</p>
